WEBVTT

00:05:24.246 --> 00:05:30.507
He said this in December 1862
to the second annual meeting of Congress.

00:05:31.198 --> 00:05:34.507
I ought to explain that I have no idea
what was happening at the time.

00:05:35.952 --> 00:05:38.705
We don't teach
American history in Britain.

00:05:38.729 --> 00:05:40.642
(Laughter)

00:05:40.666 --> 00:05:42.976
We suppress it.
You know, this is our policy.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.304
(Laughter)

00:05:46.137 --> 00:05:48.708
No doubt, something fascinating
was happening then,

00:05:48.732 --> 00:05:51.442
which the Americans among us
will be aware of.

00:05:53.347 --> 00:05:54.354
But he said this:

00:05:55.656 --> 00:06:01.801
"The dogmas of the quiet past
are inadequate to the stormy present.